# AGERC's 設定 dialog (dialog resource 9) on SC0000 page 1, opened from the menu on each of its tabs. The game holds and
# its frame stays frozen while it is open. `dialogs` lists every static text and Button control of the dialog and its
# four pages (hidden pages included, in creation order 動作環境, その他, ｻｳﾝﾄﾞ, ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ).
#
# - ﾏｳｽﾎｲｰﾙでﾒｯｾｰｼﾞを進める + OK writes message:AdvanceMesOnWheel=1, so a wheel-down at the text wait then advances.
# - 効果音 turns the SE route off live, and ｷｬﾝｾﾙ turns it back on.
# - ﾊﾞｰｼﾞｮﾝ情報 opens that dialog over 設定 (both listed, the newer first).
# - その他's check box + OK writes system:EffectSkipOnClick=1.
#
# Compare SYS4REG.INI after `close` on both targets: AdvanceMesOnWheel=1, EffectSkipOnClick=1, SE=1, Volume0..3 written
# by OK (Volume0=0 from the driver's quiet seed, 10000 for the rest). Run on a fresh sandbox, on both targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py port run tools/drive/scenarios/himegari-settings-dialog.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 1.5
click title.start
wait-state script=GAMESTART timeout=20
wait 1
click newgame.begin
wait-state top=SC0000@0x83f timeout=60  # page 1
settle

move adv.next
wheel down                              # AdvanceMesOnWheel=0: the wheel does not advance
wait 1
expect top=SC0000@0x83f

menu message-settings
wait 1.5
dialogs                                 # 設定 with every page's texts and buttons
shot settings-message
answer ﾏｳｽﾎｲｰﾙでﾒｯｾｰｼﾞを進める
wait 0.5
answer OK
wait 2
dialogs                                 # none
expect top=SC0000@0x83f
wheel down                              # now the wheel advances
wait 1.5
expect top=SC0000@0x874                 # page 2

menu sound-settings
wait 1.5
shot settings-sound
answer 効果音(&S)                       # SE route off, live
wait 0.5
answer ﾊﾞｰｼﾞｮﾝ情報
wait 1.5
dialogs                                 # ﾊﾞｰｼﾞｮﾝ情報, then 設定
answer OK                               # the version dialog's OK
wait 1
answer ｷｬﾝｾﾙ                            # SE back on
wait 2
dialogs                                 # none

menu other-settings
wait 1.5
shot settings-other
answer エフェクト中にキー入力でエフェクトをスキップ
wait 0.5
answer OK
wait 2

menu system-info
wait 2
shot settings-system
answer ｷｬﾝｾﾙ
wait 2
dialogs                                 # none
expect top=SC0000@0x874
